**• User Manual that illustrates how to use the code:**

run in the terminal 
ros2 run rov_control_system navigation_node

and in another terminal 

ros2 run rov_control_system  joystick_node

or 

in one terminal

ros2 run rov_control_system  rov_control.launch

then use the arrows in the keyboaed as if they are the joystick
